<title>USA: MBIA list secondary insurance capacity.</title>
<headline>MBIA list secondary insurance capacity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp. said Monday it has limited capacity in the following names on a first-come first-served basis.</p>
<p>--Local Government Assistance Corp (LGAC)</p>
<p>--Puerto Rico Highways</p>
<p>--New York City GOs</p>
<p>--Denver Airports</p>
<p>--New York City Municipal Waters</p>
<p>--St. Louis County Regional Convention and Sports Complex, Series 93 B</p>
<p>Please call 1-800-MBIA-NOW for lastest prices.</p>
</text>
